{{define "trial-requested-subject"}}New trial request from {{.Company}}{{end}}

{{define "trial-requested-text"}}
{{.Company}} requests a trial of Changeport ({{.ID}}).

Who: {{.Email}}, {{.Role}}
What for: {{.UseCase}}
Peak throughput: {{.Throughput}}
Messages kept: {{.Retention}}
Start: {{.Start}}

